{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will they choose\u2014friendship, or the lingering ties of past lives?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of girls\u2014of reincarnated heroes\u2014trapped between the present and memories of blood-soaked history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shirahata High School is known for its Seven Mysteries:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mirror That Reveals Past Lives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Swapping Anatomy Model</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanako on the Rooftop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tree of Wishes and Curses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ghost of a Fallen Samurai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Door That Never Opens</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors say these aren't just harmless ghost stories\u2014people have died because of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To recruit new members at the school festival, three girls from the newspaper club\u2014Onihime Asada, Asahi Nakaya, and Shana Ky\u014dzuka\u2014begin investigating the Seven Mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the first legend they explore, the Mirror That Shows Past Lives, reveals the truth:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are the reincarnations of Minamoto no Yoritomo, Minamoto no Yoshinaka, and Minamoto no Yoshitsune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old grudges awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The investigation becomes a battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Seven Mysteries become weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An occult \u00d7 reincarnation \u00d7 psychological death game visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mid-length visual novel (approx. 6 hours of playtime)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 2025, covering two intense weeks told from a third-person perspective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(but major choices are left to the player)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main endings, plus multiple bad endings based on your decisions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG Gallery with 16 unlockable illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains textual depictions of violence and suggestive content</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/e49ad69ad66597fc0e8601601ff13d6bb991eb05.jpg"},{"name":"I love Cider!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/c64e7ae9098e94a43fbd249d161f66eeb2010cc0.jpg"},{"name":"Dawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/64f853860a9279e111757e58dba05b7ab33a6cbe.jpg"},{"name":"Devoted Dog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/6b4e05d41d23ce7cc68b67b4dc9402953a72158e.jpg"},{"name":"Turning Point","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/eb7f4680e05683ff2c2081e27780c15396d6daa1.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/cd4d866c1e89d871751b827a4e042ca6937fd8ea.jpg"},{"name":"Last Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/b4881d3b88e6b6c25e251b678cb4c917111e4f75.jpg"},{"name":"Who was U N Owen?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/d0736dce9336d9b992b0b907fce64cd583be5939.jpg"},{"name":"The Unrevealed Secret","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/babab5faedf7486f265700eeff591cba11891b65.jpg"},{"name":"No Signal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3837760/b78d6318a805408b0ba05440c79f3c89a664e4a0.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepageb